  "address": "Warszawska 24, Kraków"
}

### 3. Creation of a reservation by USER1 (Resource preparation)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJyb2xlIjoiVVNFUiIsImlhdCI6MTc5MzMwODIwMCwiZXhwIjoxNzkzMzA5MTAwLCJzdWIiOiIyIn0.8LI0jnYU_bANDNndbgNrIe3PVUjeh7UqMvbX_dU9P0A
